TWEAK_NAME="Disable touchscreen"
TWEAK_RISK="high"
TWEAK_EXPERIMENTAL=1
TWEAK_DESCRIPTION="Installs a runtime into /data/opencmu/boot.d that sends com.jci.lvds.SpeedRestriction uint32:1 to /tmp/dbus_hmi_socket and re-asserts it every few seconds, so the touchscreen stays locked at every speed. It does not touch the speed thresholds in NVRAM. Requires 60-startup-hook; the runtime starts at the next boot. Rollback sends SpeedRestriction(0) before removing it."
